 $2,136 (12 × $178) | Within budget by $64; meets all hard requirements. |\n+| Atlas | `vendor_quotes.csv`, quote dated 2026-04-27 | No | — | Delivery 2026-05-18 is later than the 2026-05-17 need-by date. |\n+| BrightPath | `vendor_quotes.csv`, quote dated 2026-04-26 | No | — | Screen is 9.7 inches, below the 10.0-inch minimum. |\n+| Cobalt | `vendor_quotes.csv`, quote dated 2026-04-25 | No | — | Battery rating is 9 hours, below the 10-hour minimum. |\n+| Dockside | `vendor_quotes.csv`, quote dated 2026-04-26 | No | — | Only 11 units are available; 12 are required. |\n+\n+“Eligible” reflects all hard requirements, including required quantity and on-time delivery. Per the selection rule, only eligible vendors that also fit the budget can be selected.\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/vendor_selection/answer/purchase_recommendation.md\n+# Purchase recommendation\n+\n+**Select Northstar** for the field inspection team order.\n+\n+- **Quantity:** 12 rugged tablets\n+- **Unit price:** $178\n+- **Total:** 12 × $178 = **$2,136**\n+- **Budget:** Within the $2,200 maximum by **$64**; the quoted price includes the rugged case.\n+- **Delivery:** 2026-05-16, before the 2026-05-17 need-by date.\n+\n+Northstar's updated 2026-04-30 quote meets the quantity, 10.0-inch minimum screen, 10-hour minimum battery, included-case, 12-month warranty, and delivery requirements. Its $2,136 total is within budget. The source resolution and vendor screening are documented separately in `source_resolution.md` and `vendor_screen.md`.\n+\n+## Rejected vendors\n+\n+- **Atlas:** Delivery is 2026-05-18, after the need-by date.\n+- **BrightPath:** 9.7-inch screen is below the 10.0-inch minimum.\n+- **Cobalt:** 9-hour battery is below the 10-hour minimum.\n+- **Dockside:** Only 11 units are available, fewer than the 12 required.\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA tasks/vendor_selection/answer/source_resolution.md\nA tasks/vendor_selection/answer/ve