{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790565438615,"sessionID":"ses_f19fc7bb6ffeXwU0atHgMqpiXH","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_EH005UloEoDiFhnxlrXnbCD1","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/vendor_selection/answer/purchase_recommendation.md"},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/vendor_selection/answer/purchase_recommendation.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Purchase recommendation\n2: \n3: **Select Northstar** for the field inspection team order.\n4: \n5: - **Quantity:** 12 rugged tablets\n6: - **Unit price:** $178\n7: - **Total:** 12 × $178 = **$2,136**\n8: - **Budget:** Within the $2,200 maximum by **$64**; the quoted price includes the rugged case.\n9: - **Delivery:** 2026-05-16, before the 2026-05-17 need-by date.\n10: \n11: Northstar's updated 2026-04-30 quote meets the quantity, 10.0-inch minimum screen, 10-hour minimum battery, included-case, 12-month warranty, and delivery requirements. Its $2,136 total is within budget. The source resolution and vendor screening are documented separately in `source_resolution.md` and `vendor_screen.md`.\n12: \n13: ## Rejected vendors\n14: \n15: - **Atlas:** Delivery is 2026-05-18, after the need-by date.\n16: - **BrightPath:** 9.7-inch screen is below the 10.0-inch minimum.\n17: - **Cobalt:** 9-hour battery is below the 10-hour minimum.\n18: - **Dockside:** Only 11 units are available, fewer than the 12 required.\n\n(End of file - total 18 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Purchase recommendation\n\n**Select Northstar** for the field inspection team order.\n\n- **Quantity:** 12 rugged tablets\n- **Unit price:** $178\n- **Total:** 12 × $178 = **$2,136**\n- **Budget:** Within the $2,200 maximum by **$64**; the quoted price includes the rugged case.\n- **Delivery:** 2026-05-16, before the 2026-05-17 need-by date.\n\nNorthstar's updated 2026-04-30 quote meets the quantity, 10.0-inch minimum screen, 10-hour minimum battery, included-case, 12-month warranty, and delivery requirements. Its $2,136 total is within budget. The source resolution and vendor screening are documented separately in `source_resolution.md` and `vendor_screen.md`.\n\n## Rejected vendors\n\n- **Atlas:** Delivery is 2026-05-18, after the need-by date.\n- **BrightPath:** 9.7-inch screen is below the 10.0-inch minimum.\n- **Cobalt:** 9-hour battery is below the 10-hour minimum.\n- **Dockside:** Only 11 units are available, fewer than the 12 required.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/vendor_selection/answer/purchase_recommendation.md","text":"# Purchase recommendation\n\n**Select Northstar** for the field inspection team order.\n\n- **Quantity:** 12 rugged tablets\n- **Unit price:** $178\n- **Total:** 12 × $178 = **$2,136**\n- **Budget:** Within the $2,200 maximum by **$64**; the quoted price includes the rugged case.\n- **Delivery:** 2026-05-16, before the 2026-05-17 need-by date.\n\nNorthstar's updated 2026-04-30 quote meets the quantity, 10.0-inch minimum screen, 10-hour minimum battery, included-case, 12-month warranty, and delivery requirements. Its $2,136 total is within budget. The source resolution and vendor screening are documented separately in `source_resolution.md` and `vendor_screen.md`.\n\n## Rejected vendors\n\n- **Atlas:** Delivery is 2026-05-18, after the need-by date.\n- **BrightPath:** 9.7-inch screen is below the 10.0-inch minimum.\n- **Cobalt:** 9-hour battery is below the 10-hour minimum.\n- **Dockside:** Only 11 units are available, fewer than the 12 required.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":18,"totalLines":18,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/vendor_selection/answer/purchase_recommendation.md","time":{"start":1790565438603,"end":1790565438614}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_054d05e88af3bbd5016ab9dc3e881c87d29ed3f27beafd5def"}},"id":"prt_0e6045481001IPTwmuNMnpCZKw","sessionID":"ses_f19fc7bb6ffeXwU0atHgMqpiXH","messageI